WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.080
A single AAV injection improved fatty liver and diabetes markers and lipodistrophy mice for at

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:11.580
least two months. This is Planetterrian Daily, episode 254. After that, a genetic model of

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:17.580
multiple sclerosis after Epstein bar, Darwin's finches and their beaks, tobacco plants making

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:24.080
a cancer drug precursor, and a science deep dive. Researchers at the Roate Institute at the University

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:30.400
of Aberdeen, tested an adeno-associated virus, or AAV, carrying leptin instructions in mice

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.960
with generalized lipodistrophy. Hunger fell as well on top of the liver and diabetes changes.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:41.220
The disorder limits the body's ability to store fat and brings a rare form of diabetes,

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:47.280
fatty liver disease, persistent hunger, and chronic pain. Today's treatment means daily leptin

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:52.580
shots for life, painful when there is little subcutaneous fat to inject into, expensive,

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.760
intensive and dependent on refrigeration.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:00.320
Dr. Nadine Somer, who led the work, noted the effects match daily leptin shots in patients.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:05.840
Lower doses are now under test before any human translation, which would require a different

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:06.840
AAV vector.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:13.820
Support came from the East of Scotland Bio-Science Doctoral Training Partnership, BBSRC, and

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:18.040
Diabetes UK and Lipo-Distrophy UK and Lipo-Distrophy United.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.340
Welcome the result as a path to a lighter treatment load.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:28.795
Epstein-bar virus infects about 90% of people, and a PNAS experimental model shows that specific

00:01:28.795 --> 00:01:33.235
immune system gene variants determine why only a small fraction of those infections

00:01:33.235 --> 00:01:34.955
progress to multiple sclerosis.

00:01:35.635 --> 00:01:40.515
The model identifies how those variants allow the virus to trigger autoimmune damage rather

00:01:40.515 --> 00:01:41.555
than remaining harmless.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:47.715
It is the immune gene background, not infection alone, that lets Epstein-bar start that damage

00:01:47.715 --> 00:01:48.835
in susceptible people.

00:01:48.835 --> 00:01:56.627
Insect foraging finches in forested Galapagos areas in a Fizz.org report carry genetic mosaics

00:01:56.627 --> 00:02:00.267
that help account for the range of beak forms suited to different food sources.

00:02:00.827 --> 00:02:05.327
The team studied those forest birds rather than the more studied seed-eating ground finches.

00:02:06.107 --> 00:02:11.487
Pakletaxle, a widely used cancer drug, had its biosynthetic steps mapped so production might

00:02:11.487 --> 00:02:14.407
move from slow uteres to faster growing tobacco.

00:02:14.407 --> 00:02:20.107
The work targets cheaper, more scalable manufacturing as cancer diagnoses rise globally.

00:02:20.847 --> 00:02:26.007
Damage mitochondria in bone received engineered nanoparticles that restored function and improved

00:02:26.007 --> 00:02:30.927
regeneration in diabetic rat models, where standard healing is impaired by the disease.

00:02:31.527 --> 00:02:36.387
The particles go at cellular energy deficits directly rather than at downstream symptoms.

00:02:36.947 --> 00:02:41.847
Ben Gurion University and Volcani Institute researchers showed that prickly paracactus

00:02:41.847 --> 00:02:47.927
activates two distinct physiological modes, one to survive long droughts, and one to exploit brief

00:02:47.927 --> 00:02:53.287
rains. The dual strategy lets the plant take carbon efficiently while water is present and

00:02:53.287 --> 00:02:59.587
conserve resources when it is not. Disrupting one gene in petunias altered both pigment pathways and

00:02:59.587 --> 00:03:05.227
the blend of volatile scent compounds. Some vanilla and clove-associated volatiles increased,

00:03:05.767 --> 00:03:09.687
which shows the same cellular machinery shapes petal color and scent together.

00:03:09.687 --> 00:03:15.507
Institute of Science and Technology Austria-Scientists imaged the internal structure of Pox virus

00:03:15.507 --> 00:03:15.967
cores.

00:03:16.527 --> 00:03:22.047
Gene copying enzymes sit in dormant pairs beside export portals in the shell, ready to

00:03:22.047 --> 00:03:25.267
transcribe viral genes once the virus enters a host cell.

00:03:25.847 --> 00:03:30.707
Fundamental fluid equations paired with machine learning at the University of California Irvine

00:03:31.287 --> 00:03:34.807
reconstructed complete flow fields from sparse or noisy measurements.

00:03:34.807 --> 00:03:39.947
The method improves accuracy for medical imaging of blood movement where sensors capture

00:03:39.947 --> 00:03:41.127
only partial data.

00:03:41.727 --> 00:03:46.887
Patients undergoing coronary angiography with or without percutaneous coronary intervention,

00:03:47.347 --> 00:03:53.267
or PCI, enter to randomize trial highlighted by Eric Topel that assigned 100 people to

00:03:53.267 --> 00:03:55.187
music before and during the procedure.

00:03:55.687 --> 00:04:00.927
The music group showed a 13-millimeter lower post-procedure systolic blood pressure and

00:04:00.927 --> 00:04:01.947
a reduced heart rate.

00:04:01.947 --> 00:04:06.825
Something most people get wrong is that a violin physically improves with use.

00:04:07.305 --> 00:04:12.105
As if regular playing loosens wood fibers or altars resonances, so the instrument literally

00:04:12.105 --> 00:04:13.925
opens up over months or years.

00:04:14.545 --> 00:04:19.765
A CNRS researcher ran a controlled six-month trial of that belief with a new violin played

00:04:19.765 --> 00:04:21.685
daily by a professional soloist.

00:04:22.105 --> 00:04:26.705
At the end, the player reported the instrument felt easier to play and its tone had improved.

00:04:27.325 --> 00:04:31.445
Repeated physical and acoustic measurements found no measurable change in the wood.

00:04:31.445 --> 00:04:35.025
varnish, or vibrational properties that could explain the difference.

00:04:35.665 --> 00:04:39.665
The gap between what the player heard and what the instrument did points to adaptation

00:04:39.665 --> 00:04:43.865
in the player's own touch, bow pressure, and auditory expectation.

00:04:44.525 --> 00:04:49.405
Claims of breaking in an instrument therefore rest on subjective experience rather than detectable

00:04:49.405 --> 00:04:50.285
material shifts.

00:04:50.965 --> 00:04:55.305
Future work could test whether longer periods or different playing styles produce measurable

00:04:55.305 --> 00:05:00.045
effects, or whether listener panels blind to playing history reach the same judgments,

00:05:00.045 --> 00:05:05.525
and players might focus practice time on technique rather than expecting the wood itself to change.

00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:12.371
Harriet Watt University researchers in a Fizz.org report interviewed Scottish food producers and

00:05:12.371 --> 00:05:17.671
wholesalers and ran six case studies that range from family run producers to island wholesalers.

00:05:18.131 --> 00:05:24.871
Small and medium-sized enterprises or SMEs make up around 95% of Scotland's food and drink sector,

00:05:25.351 --> 00:05:30.011
and the study found a mismatch between available grants and the upfront investment those small

00:05:30.011 --> 00:05:32.491
firms need to decarbonize their cold chains.

00:05:33.546 --> 00:05:38.346
In brief, researchers from Australia and the United States, in a biotech dispatch report,

00:05:38.786 --> 00:05:43.446
are pooling expertise to develop therapies for several rare pediatric genetic disorders.

00:05:44.086 --> 00:05:49.686
An experimental gene therapy reported by LaVosda Madrid showed measurable auditory gains

00:05:49.686 --> 00:05:52.726
after treatment in children with profound congenital deafness.

00:05:53.226 --> 00:05:58.686
Before we go, lower dose tests of the leptin gene therapy are the next gate in mice, and

00:05:58.686 --> 00:06:02.926
And any human work would still need a different viral vector than the one used in that model.

